Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:21.17,Name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}AI Company Health\N{\fs22\b0}An agentic AI project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:05.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}I built AI Company Health.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}It's an agentic AI project:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:13.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}a simulated health insurer where every single employee is an AI agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:16.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Fifty of them, across twelve departments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:21.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}competing for customers in a town of a hundred AI residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:25.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}This is the town, Wattle Grove.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Every resident has a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:27.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}an income, a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}and their own memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:31.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Health cover is compulsory here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:33.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}so each of them picks a fund,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}one of nine rivals, or us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:40.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Click on anyone, and you see their whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:43.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Where they work, which fund they're with and why,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:45.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}every claim and every conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:48.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And nothing in the company's numbers is scripted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:51.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Every sale and every claim comes from a decision a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:53.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}resident actually made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}This is head office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Each agent has a role,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:03.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}its own tools that query the company's live data, and long-term memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}This is Leo, our head of sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:09.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}I track token usage for every agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:12.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}day by day, so I can see exactly what each
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:14.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}one costs to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And I can just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:26.72,Ff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}>> Sped up 4x: the agents are working live
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Before answering, he checked the real numbers with his own tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And he'll remember this conversation next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:45.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}I can also call a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Pick a room, who should be there, and an agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.30,Ff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}>> Sped up 4x: the agents are working live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:04.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}They walk up to the boardroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}each one builds a deck from the live data,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:08.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}and they present it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:09.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}right there on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Then the minutes get written up automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:23.70,Ff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}>> Sped up 34x: the agents are working live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:33.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}So, what has it actually achieved?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Over thirty-five simulated days,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:39.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}policies in force went from twenty to forty-six, with zero cancellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}That's made us the number one fund in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}with about forty-five percent of the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Customer satisfaction is sitting at a hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}every claim met its service target,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:56.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}and the business is running at around a twenty percent margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:02.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}The agents have also produced over thirty documents on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Decks, dashboards, reports and meeting minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:08.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And every number in them is fact-checked against the data,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:10.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}so if an agent gets something wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:12.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}it's flagged, and the agent learns from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Under the hood, every model call is tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:21.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}So far, that's over five thousand calls and more than
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}fifty million tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:24.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And every run is traced,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:27.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}so I can see exactly which tools an agent used,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}and what came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Every Monday, the CEO agent reviews last week's goals and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:34.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}sets new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:38.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}And an evaluation suite checks that agents answer with real
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:39.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}numbers, not guesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Right now, they pass five out of six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}It's built with Google's Agent Development Kit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:04:03.89,Name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Google ADK  ·  Vertex AI  ·  A2A  ·  LangGraph  ·  Three.js  ·  Google Cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:49.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Vertex AI, A2A for agent-to-agent communication,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}LangGraph for the workflows,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}and a 3D front end in Three.js,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:56.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}all running on Google Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Thanks for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:59.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}I'd love to hear what you think!
